WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.500
/demo: the problem, the agent's loop and where the AI acts.

2
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:28.000
"Sign in as Andina Labs": the tutorial shows the Inbox and "Run agent".

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The Inbox: every invoice with what the agent decided and why.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
New invoice: I upload 01.pdf and the agent reads it and decides it.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Its record: STOP, exact duplicate; every rule checked.

6
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
The invoice with the changed account: I reject it.

7
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Nube Sur is over the threshold: I approve it and it ends in PAY with its payment order.

8
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Policy: I lower a limit, save the version and re-evaluate the pending ones.

9
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:08.080
Period: autonomy, violations and the month's money.
